{"id":"n28941-1-10","stage":3,"title":"지출 · 支出","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28941-1-10-1","ko":"올해는 작년에 비해 회사 자금의 지출이 많이 늘었군.","zh":"今年公司的资金支出相比去年增加了很多啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"올해는","meaning":"今年","explanation":"올해：今年；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"올해","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67842","senseId":"1","lemma":"올해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올해는","audio":"/audio/c6e3aef40e5636a9bf29.mp3"}},{"text":"작년에","meaning":"去年","explanation":"작년：去年；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"작년","audio":"/audio/201b780a33a41d77aa74.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30184","senseId":"1","lemma":"작년","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"작년에","audio":"/audio/7c78c243ce7308b59ad9.mp3"}},{"text":"비해","meaning":"比起","explanation":"비하다：比起；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"비하다","audio":"/audio/f5d55c30842200d89171.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15641","senseId":"2","lemma":"비하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비해","audio":"/audio/71a7453acd8ba8fcae2b.mp3"}},{"text":"회사","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}},{"text":"자금의","meaning":"资金","explanation":"자금：资金；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"자금","audio":"/audio/e3976202051f16b9ad21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73927","senseId":"1","lemma":"자금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자금의","audio":"/audio/fd30b89e1c96cd9c6c48.mp3"}},{"text":"지출이","meaning":"支出","explanation":"지출：支出；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"지출","audio":"/audio/1ed4f1ad1c21e9b65d0d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28941","senseId":"1","lemma":"지출",